Package: humanitl
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Niko Burkert <humanitl@nurkert.de>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: libsecret-tools
Suggests: opencode
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nurkert/Humanitl
Description: Human-in-the-loop network moderation for AI coding agents
 Runs an AI coding agent in a sandbox without a network interface and
 holds every outbound request for human review.
 .
 Releases before 1.0.0 are unsigned; each release carries SHA256SUMS.
